<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Medialink said started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Medialink said started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter started coverage of Medialink Worldwide Inc with a buy rating, a source at Dean Witter said.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/8 to 10.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
